# The hxcpp arm of the typed-JSON benchmark (`tools/src/dev/JsonProf.hx`): the same source the js arm runs as
# `node bin/dev.js parse-prof json-…`, so the arms differ only in the backend. Build from the repo root with a
# persistent HXCPP_COMPILE_CACHE, then pass bin/json-prof-cpp/JsonProf to `dev bench-ab` as any other arm.
-cp src
-cp tools/src
-main dev.JsonProf
-D analyzer-optimize
-cpp bin/json-prof-cpp
